===========================================================================
Verdict
===========================================================================
FAIL. Finding 1 is a real, reproduced weakening of a named escalation
safeguard in swarm/gate.sh, broader than the commit that introduced it
discloses. Finding 2 is an incomplete self-audit in REVIEW_AUG20_SPEC.md: the
lead documents catching one premise error in a judge's OVERRULE reasoning
while silently missing a more fundamental one (the judge arguing from the
wrong tier) in the same verdict, on a document whose explicit charter is to
record the run's own errors accurately and completely.
